# Twinkle Twinkle Poem

## Purpose

This program prints the complete poem stored in a triple-quoted string. It
demonstrates multiline string literals, line breaks, blank lines, and sending
text to the terminal with `print`.

## Requirements

- Python 3
- No third-party packages

## Run

From this folder, run:

```text
python twinkle_poem.py
```

The poem is printed with its original line and stanza breaks.

## How it works

The `""" ... """` delimiters let the poem span multiple source-code lines.
Python retains those line breaks in the string. The call to `print` writes the
result to standard output.

## Flow diagram

```text
Start
  |
  v
Create multiline poem string
  |
  v
Pass string to print
  |
  v
Display poem in terminal
  |
  v
End
```
